<section class="content-section" id="who-section">
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="text-content">
            <h2 class="section-title">Who Receives ROC Notices in Pune?</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                
                <p><strong>Companies with Pending Annual Filings:</strong> Any company registered with ROC Pune that has not filed AOC-4 and/or MGT-7 within prescribed dates. Additional fees of Rs 100/day accrue. Non-filing for 2 consecutive years triggers strike-off. Related: <a href="#">Annual ROC Filing in Pune</a>.</p><p><strong>Dormant and Inactive Companies:</strong> Companies at Baner and Kharadi that incorporated but never commenced operations. See also <a href="/one-person-company-registration">OPC Registration</a>.</p><p><strong>LLPs with Pending Form 8 and Form 11:</strong> LLPs at Koregaon Park and Baner consulting firms. Non-filing for 2 years may lead to LLP strike-off. Related: <a href="#">LLP Registration in Pune</a>.</p><p><strong>Directors Subject to Disqualification:</strong> Individuals on boards of companies with 3+ years of non-filing. Affects Hinjewadi and Baner founders with multiple directorships - one company's non-compliance triggers DIN deactivation across all.</p>

