<!-- SECTION 7: 7-STEP PROCESS -->
<section class="steps-section" id="procedure-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <header class="section-header" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
            <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Process</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">How to Respond to a ROC Notice in Pune</h2>
            <p class="section-subtitle" style="text-align:left;max-width:100%;">Our Pune CA+CS team manages the entire ROC notice response - from notice review to filing, representation and ongoing compliance setup.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="steps-container">
            <div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 1</span><h3 class="step-title">Identify the Notice Type and Deadline</h3><p class="step-description">Download the notice from MCA21 V3 portal using your company CIN. Identify whether it is a strike-off notice (STK-1), adjudication notice (Section 454), director disqualification, or deficiency notice. Note the response deadline - typically 30 days. For Pune companies, ROC notices are served electronically (MCA portal) and physically (registered office). Patron reviews the notice and maps response strategy within 24 hours.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Notice type identified</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>30-day deadline noted</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="20" y="10" width="80" height="55" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="60" y="28" font-size="7" fill="#E8712C" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">STK-1?</text><text x="60" y="42" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">or Sec 454?</text><text x="60" y="78" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Identify Type</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Reviewed</span><span class="step-number-large">01</span></div></div></div>
<div class="step-card"><div class="step-content"><span class="step-badge">Step 2</span><h3 class="step-title">Assess Pending Compliance and Financial Statements</h3><p class="step-description">Compile all pending annual filings: AOC-4 (financial statements), MGT-7/MGT-7A (annual return), ADT-1 (auditor appointment), DIR-3 KYC, DPT-3, and event-based forms. For Hinjewadi IT subsidiaries and Kharadi startups, pending filings often span 2-5 financial years. Prepare or obtain audited financial statements for each pending year.</p><div class="step-highlights"><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Pending forms listed</span><span class="highlight-tag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>Audit reports obtained</span></div></div><div class="step-visual"><div class="step-illustration"><div class="illustration-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="15" y="5" width="90" height="70" rx="6" fill="#F0F4F8" stroke="#14365F" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="25" y="15" width="40" height="8" rx="3" fill="#E8712C" opacity="0.3"/><text x="45" y="21" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">AOC-4</text><rect x="25" y="28" width="40" height="8" rx="3" fill="#F5A623" opacity="0.3"/><text x="45" y="34" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">MGT-7</text><rect x="25" y="41" width="40" height="8" rx="3" fill="#14365F" opacity="0.1"/><text x="45" y="47" font-size="5" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">ADT-1</text><text x="60" y="72" font-size="6" fill="#14365F" font-weight="600" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial">Assess Pending</text></svg></div><span class="illustration-label">Assessed</span><span class="step-number-large">02</span></div></div></div>
